# Atomic Microsizer's trigger is "up to one target creature" (CR 601.2c). Bot1 has an Ornithopter (equipped, 1/2) and Bot2 has one (0/2). On turn 3 the
# trigger targets Bot2's Ornithopter: it becomes 1/1 (the toughness shows the base-setting effect) and Bot2 declines to block, taking 1. On turn 5
# the trigger targets nothing: Bot2's Ornithopter is its printed 0/2 again, blocks, takes 1 damage, and no damage reaches Bot2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Atomic Microsizer
Ornithopter
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x16

